      "content": "Dear Miller Family,\n\nI wanted to share another brief update. I'm thinking of embracing the present moment with Robert, and taking solace in the love and support always surrounding him.\n\nThrough these things we are sharing, we feel your family's love and memories bringing hope to Robert. As we care for him, rest easy knowing our hearts are intact for him.\n\nWe value our connection with you and hope this fosters peace within each of us. Please let us know if we can make any more plans ahead of time.\n\nWith affection,\n\n[Your Name]",
      "source": "target",
